{"items":[{"city":"bj","color":"#F4C1CA","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"bj22","source":"北京日报","source_en":"Beijing Daily","summary":"22号线（平谷线）平谷段四站四区间建设已全部完成，其中马坊物流港站、马昌营站、平谷站已通过工程验收，站内装修和出入口建设均已完成，站前广场完成80%，区间铺轨、电力架设、信号安装全部完成，目前正在进行通车试运行。红庙至平谷段8月25日已进入空载试运行，全线20座车站主体结构封顶、附属结构完成96%、设备安装装修完成90%，年底基本具备开通条件。作为进入平谷的第一站，马坊物流港站周边正推进产城融合布局，平谷区已在地铁沿线布局人才住房1300余套；京平综合物流枢纽铁路北场区将于12月28日建成通车。通车后平谷城区到红庙站约53分钟，燕郊至北京城市副中心最快9分钟，将大幅缓解跨省通勤压力。","summary_en":"Construction of the four stations and four sections on the Pinggu stretch of Line 22 (Pinggu Line) is complete: Mafang Logistics Port, Machangying and Pinggu stations have passed project acceptance, with station fitting-out and entrances finished, station squares 80% done, and track laying, power and signalling all complete; trial running ahead of opening is under way. The Hongmiao–Pinggu section entered no-load trial operation on 25 August, with all 20 station structures topped out, ancillary works 96% complete and equipment and finishing 90% complete; it should basically be ready to open by year-end. Mafang Logistics Port, the first station into Pinggu, is the focus of a new industry–city development push, with more than 1,300 talent-housing units planned along the line, and the Jingping logistics hub's north rail yard opens on 28 December. Once open, Pinggu to Hongmiao will take about 53 minutes, and Yanjiao to Beijing's sub-centre as little as 9 minutes, easing cross-province commuting.","title":"北京22号线预计2026年底开通","title_en":"Beijing Line 22 expected to open by end of 2026"},{"city":"sh","color":"#401AA6","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"sh22","source":"上海轨道交通 / 上海崇明","source_en":"Shanghai Metro / Shanghai Chongming","summary":"22号线（崇明线）全长约42.9公里、设8座车站，自浦东金吉路至崇明裕安，最高时速120公里，是上海首条跨长江地铁线，2026年4月已实现全线轨道贯通，目前正推进车辆交付与调试，力争年底具备开通条件。首批7列车已交付，列车采用GoA4全自动无人驾驶系统，车厢首次设置弧形“家庭座”，高峰6节、低谷3节灵活编组，出现小故障可无感持续运行并自行回库检修。通车后崇明将首次接入上海地铁网，东滩至浦东金桥约30分钟。","summary_en":"Line 22 (Chongming Line) runs about 42.9 km with 8 stations, from Jinji Road in Pudong to Yu'an on Chongming Island, at up to 120 km/h — Shanghai's first metro line across the Yangtze. Track laying finished in April 2026 and vehicle delivery and testing are under way, aiming to be ready for opening by year-end. The first seven trainsets have been delivered; they run in GoA4 fully automatic mode, with the first-ever curved 'family seats' in the cars and flexible 3-car off-peak / 6-car peak formation, and can keep running through minor faults and return to the depot unaided. Once open, Chongming joins the Shanghai metro network for the first time, with Dongtan to Jinqiao in about 30 minutes.","title":"上海22号线预计2026年底开通","title_en":"Shanghai Line 22 expected to open by end of 2026"},{"city":"gz","color":"#59621D","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"gz12","source":"广州地铁 / 广州日报","source_en":"Guangzhou Metro / Guangzhou Daily","summary":"12号线中段（广州体育馆—二沙岛）全长8.8公里、设7座车站，土建工程已基本完成，10月31日起与东西两段启动贯通跑图试运行；11月20日，广州地铁确认中段7座车站及轨行区已全部完成临时“三权”移交，正开展系统综合联调及不载客试运行。建设六马路站将与五号线淘金站实现付费区换乘。按计划年底开通后，12号线将实现浔峰岗至大学城南全线贯通，广州地铁运营里程将迈上800公里新台阶。","summary_en":"The 8.8 km, 7-station middle section of Line 12 (Guangzhou Gymnasium – Ersha Island) has largely finished civil works and began through trial running with the east and west sections on 31 October; on 20 November Guangzhou Metro confirmed all seven stations and the track area have completed the provisional handover of the three management rights, and system integration testing and no-load trial running are now under way. Jianshe Liulu station will offer a paid-area interchange with Line 5’s Taojin station. Once it opens by year-end as planned, Line 12 will run through from Xunfenggang to Higher Education Mega Center South, and Guangzhou’s network will pass 800 km.","title":"广州12号线中段预计2026年底开通","title_en":"Guangzhou Line 12 (middle section) expected to open by end of 2026"},{"city":"gz","color":"#888600","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"gz13","source":"广州地铁 / 广州日报","source_en":"Guangzhou Metro / Guangzhou Daily","summary":"13号线二期西段（鸦岗—天河公园）全长25.3公里、设19座车站，10月24日起进入贯通跑图试运行，11月15日全部车站完成移交运营调试，11月16日跑图阶段结束；11月20日，广州地铁确认19座车站及轨行区已全部完成临时“三权”移交，正开展系统综合联调及不载客试运行，同日移交的还有建设六马路站、仓边路站。自11月17日起，既有13号线（天河公园至新沙）列车到发时刻相应调整，天河公园站乘客下车站台也有所调整，广州地铁提醒乘客提前留意站内指引。按计划年底开通后，13号线将实现朝阳至鱼珠全线贯通，有助于分流5号线东西向通勤压力，广州地铁运营里程将迈上800公里新台阶。","summary_en":"The 25.3 km, 19-station western section of Line 13 Phase 2 (Yagang – Tianhe Park) began through trial running on 24 October; all 19 stations were handed over for operational testing on 15 November and the trial-running phase ended on 16 November. On 20 November Guangzhou Metro confirmed all 19 stations and the track area have completed the provisional handover of the three management rights, with system integration testing and no-load trial running under way; Jianshe Liulu and Cangbianlu stations were handed over the same day. From 17 November, timetables on the existing Line 13 (Tianhe Park – Xinsha) were adjusted and the alighting platform at Tianhe Park changed, with passengers advised to check station signs. Once it opens by year-end as planned, Line 13 will run through from Chaoyang to Yuzhu, easing east–west commuter pressure on Line 5, and Guangzhou’s network will pass 800 km.","title":"广州13号线二期西段预计2026年底开通","title_en":"Guangzhou Line 13 Phase 2 (west section) expected to open by end of 2026"},{"city":"sy","color":"#FEDC00","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"sy6","source":"沈阳轨道交通","source_en":"Shenyang Metro","summary":"在建，预计2027年开通。","summary_en":"Under construction, expected to open in 2027.","title":"沈阳6号线预计2027年开通","title_en":"Shenyang Line 6 expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"sy","color":"#0095D2","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"sy9","source":"沈阳轨道交通","source_en":"Shenyang Metro","summary":"在建，预计2027年开通。","summary_en":"Under construction, expected to open in 2027.","title":"沈阳9号线二期预计2027年开通","title_en":"Shenyang Line 9 Phase 2 expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"sz","color":"#DE7C00","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"sz13","source":"广东省交通运输厅","source_en":"Guangdong Provincial Department of Transport","summary":"13号线二期（南延）始于东角头站、终于深圳湾口岸站，全长约4.1公里，全线地下敷设、设站3座，建成后将进一步满足南山蛇口片区市民的出行需求。目前车站主体已全部完成，正按计划推进，预计2027年开通。13号线一期南段已于2024年底投入运营，全线于2025年底贯通，北延段于2026年6月28日开通。","summary_en":"The south extension of Line 13 Phase 2 runs from Dongjiaotou to Shenzhen Bay Checkpoint, about 4.1 km fully underground with 3 stations, and will further serve travel demand in Shekou, Nanshan, once open. Station structures are now 100% complete and work is proceeding as planned towards a 2027 opening. The southern section of Line 13 Phase 1 entered service at the end of 2024, the full Phase 1 line opened at the end of 2025, and the northern extension opened on 28 June 2026.","title":"深圳13号线南延预计2027年开通","title_en":"Shenzhen Line 13 (south extension) expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"cq","color":"#0057B8","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"cq27","source":"新重庆-重庆晨报","source_en":"New Chongqing – Chongqing Morning Post","summary":"27003车、27004车已于近日运抵璧山停车场并完成吊装落轨，车辆接收取得阶段性进展，为后续车辆调试、全线联调联试打下基础。27号线全长约56公里、设15座车站，设计时速140公里，仍按计划推进，预计2027年开通。","summary_en":"Trains 27003 and 27004 have arrived at the Bishan depot and been lifted onto the tracks, a milestone in vehicle delivery ahead of testing and full-line joint commissioning. Line 27 runs about 56 km with 15 stations at a design speed of 140 km/h, and remains on schedule for a 2027 opening.","title":"重庆27号线一期预计2027年开通","title_en":"Chongqing Line 27 Phase 1 expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"cd","color":"#A7C6ED","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"cdS5","source":"成都轨道交通","source_en":"Chengdu Metro","summary":"在建，预计2027年开通。","summary_en":"Under construction, expected to open in 2027.","title":"成都S5线预计2027年开通","title_en":"Chengdu Line S5 expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"tj","color":"#006BA6","date":"预计2027","date_en":"Expected 2027","id":"tjZ2","source":"新浪网","source_en":"Sina.com","summary":"Z2线一期是串联天津中心城区与滨海新区的骨干轨道交通线路，沿线串联空港经济区、经开区西区、高新区渤龙湖科技园、滨海—中关村科技园等重点产业片区。11月19日，洞庭路站跨洞庭路连续梁施工顺利完成，较既定节点提前13天，标志着该项目重难点跨路施工取得关键性突破，为后续区间结构贯通创造了条件。线路仍按计划推进，预计2027年开通。","summary_en":"Line Z2 Phase 1 is the backbone metro line linking central Tianjin with Binhai New Area, serving the Airport Economic Zone, the western Tianjin Economic-Technological Development Area, the Bolonghu Science Park and the Binhai–Zhongguancun Science Park. On 19 November, the continuous beam crossing Dongting Road at Dongtinglu station was completed, 13 days ahead of schedule — a breakthrough on one of the project’s hardest road-crossing sections, paving the way for the remaining structural works. The line remains on schedule for a 2027 opening.","title":"天津Z2线预计2027年开通","title_en":"Tianjin Line Z2 expected to open in 2027"},{"city":"bj","color":"#888888","date":"2026年11月23日","date_en":"23 November 2026","id":"bj15w","source":"千龙网","source_en":"Qianlong.com","summary":"日前正式发布的《北京市“十五五”时期现代综合交通运输体系发展规划》明确，到2030年，北京城市轨道交通运营里程将达1050公里以上，较2025年底的909公里新增140多公里。北京市交通委相关负责人解读称，北京将通过新线建设“补空白”、存量线路“提效率”实现这一目标，重点推进1号线支线、3号线一期剩余段、22号线（平谷线）、28号线（CBD线）、13号线扩能提升工程、城市副中心M101线一期等线路建设，并加快亦庄线与5号线、10号线联络线等工程。规划还提出对环京通勤廊道实行“一廊一策”分类提速，其中东向国贸—通州—燕郊廊道重点加快22号线建设，以缓解潮汐式通勤压力。","summary_en":"The newly released Beijing 15th Five-Year Plan for a modern comprehensive transport system sets a target of more than 1,050 km of urban rail in operation by 2030, up from 909 km at the end of 2025. The Beijing Municipal Commission of Transport said the city will fill network gaps with new lines — including the Line 1 branch, the remaining section of Line 3 Phase 1, Line 22 (Pinggu Line), Line 28 (CBD Line), the Line 13 capacity upgrade and the M101 Line Phase 1 in the sub-centre — while improving efficiency on existing lines, and will build links between the Yizhuang Line and Lines 5 and 10. The plan also applies a corridor-by-corridor approach to commuting around Beijing, with the eastward Guomao–Tongzhou–Yanjiao corridor prioritising faster construction of Line 22 to ease tidal commuting pressure.","title":"北京“十五五”规划：2030年轨道交通里程突破1050公里","title_en":"Beijing's 15th Five-Year Plan: metro network to exceed 1,050 km by 2030"},{"city":"cd","color":"#888888","date":"2026年11月23日","date_en":"23 November 2026","id":"cdmx","source":"中国新闻网","source_en":"China News Service","summary":"11月23日上午，市域（郊）铁路成眉线官塘站至煎茶站区间最后一榀预制箱梁精准落位，全线1544个墩柱、1181榀预制箱梁、91座现浇梁全部完成，桥梁主体结构连通，标志着成眉线实现全线贯通，建设重心随即全面转向轨道铺设、机电安装和车站装修等站后工程。成眉线全长59.139公里，起于成都红莲站、止于眉山东站，其中高架桥长46.18公里、占全长超八成，跨越岷江等江河；全线13座车站土建主体结构已全部完工，地下区间全部贯通，轨道铺设已完成60%。作为成德眉资同城化“2环3射”骨干通勤网络的重要项目，成眉线建成后将推动成都、眉山迈入“轨道同城”时代。","summary_en":"On the morning of 23 November, the final prefabricated box girder was placed on the Guantang–Jiancha section of the Chengdu–Meishan suburban railway, completing all 1,544 piers, 1,181 box girders and 91 cast-in-place beams — the bridge structures are now fully connected, and construction shifts to track laying, electromechanical installation and station finishing. The 59.139 km line runs from Honglian in Chengdu to Meishan East, with 46.18 km of elevated viaduct crossing the Min River and other waterways; all 13 stations' civil structures are complete, underground sections are through, and 60% of track is laid. As a key part of the Chengdu–Deyang–Meishan–Ziyang \"2 rings, 3 radials\" commuter network, the line will bring Chengdu and Meishan into a single rail-connected twin-city era once open.","title":"市域（郊）铁路成眉线全线贯通","title_en":"Chengdu–Meishan suburban railway fully connected"},{"city":"dl","color":"#888888","date":"在建 · 延期","date_en":"Under construction · Delayed","id":"dl4","source":"大连轨道交通","source_en":"Dalian Metro","summary":"大连4号线建设延期，开通时间未定。","summary_en":"Dalian Line 4 construction is delayed; no opening date announced.","title":"大连4号线建设延期","title_en":"Dalian Line 4 construction delayed"},{"city":"hf","color":"#888888","date":"2026年11月19日","date_en":"19 November 2026","id":"hfS1","source":"市场星报","source_en":"Market Star News","summary":"11月19日，合肥轨道S1线（合肥段）省中医院西区站至新桥2号航站楼站区段正式开通初期运营，全长约31.3公里，安全评估等各项开通筹备工作已全部完成。作为市域快线，S1线着力打造一站式智慧出行体系，将大幅缩短合肥主城区与新桥国际机场之间的通勤时间。","summary_en":"On 19 November, the Hefei section of Line S1 (Shengzhongyiyuan West Zone – Xinqiao Terminal 2) entered initial operation. The roughly 31.3 km section completed all safety assessments and opening preparations. As a suburban express line built around one-stop smart travel, it will sharply cut travel time between central Hefei and Xinqiao International Airport.","title":"合肥S1线（合肥段）11月19日开通初期运营","title_en":"Hefei Line S1 (Hefei section) opens for trial operation on 19 November"},{"city":"wlmq","color":"#888888","date":"2026年11月15日","date_en":"15 November 2026","id":"wlmq2","source":"中国新闻网","source_en":"China News Service","summary":"11月15日，乌鲁木齐地铁2号线北段（华山街—南门）开通运营，全长约13.94公里、设10座车站，乘客可在南门站与1号线无缝换乘，打通主城区到高铁枢纽的快速通道。乌鲁木齐由此正式进入“双地铁城市”行列，2号线运营时间为7:40至23:30，全程最高票价4元。","summary_en":"On 15 November, the northern section of Ürümqi Metro Line 2 (Huashan Street – Nanmen) opened for operation. The roughly 13.94 km section serves 10 stations, with a seamless interchange to Line 1 at Nanmen, opening a fast link from the city centre to the high-speed rail hub. Ürümqi is now officially a two-line metro city; Line 2 runs 07:40–23:30 with a maximum fare of ¥4.","title":"乌鲁木齐地铁2号线北段开通运营","title_en":"Ürümqi Metro Line 2 (north section) opens for operation"},{"city":"cc","color":"#888888","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"cc1s","source":"中国吉林网","source_en":"China Jilin Net","summary":"据吉林省发展和改革委员会消息，长春轨道交通1号线南延工程已进入空载试运行阶段，采取分段开通方案：先期段红石、兴创路、兴博路、兴启路4站计划2026年底开通，柳家、永春南两站计划2027年底开通。南延线全长7公里，沿人民大街向南延伸，将扩大1号线服务范围，优化南部区域公共交通体系。","summary_en":"According to the Jilin Provincial Development and Reform Commission, the south extension of Changchun Line 1 has entered no-load trial operation and will open in stages: the first four stations (Hongshi, Xingchuanglu, Xingbolu, Xingqilu) are planned to open by the end of 2026, with Liujia and Yongchunnan to follow by the end of 2027. The 7 km extension runs south along Renmin Avenue, widening Line 1's coverage and improving public transport in the city's south.","title":"长春1号线南延进入空载试运行，先期段预计年底开通","title_en":"Changchun Line 1 south extension enters trial operation; first section expected by year-end"},{"city":"gz","color":"#888888","date":"预计2026年底","date_en":"Expected end of 2026","id":"gz4gq","source":"广州日报","source_en":"Guangzhou Daily","summary":"11月20日，广州地铁确认四号线官桥站已顺利完成临时“三权”移交，车站属地管理权、调度指挥权、设备使用权正式移交运营单位，标志着官桥站由建设阶段转入运营调试阶段，将在年底前开通运营。官桥站位于番禺区，北接新造站、南连石碁站，为高架侧式车站，开通后将与广东城际官桥北站实现换乘，进一步增强四号线对广州“南拓轴”沿线地区的带动作用。","summary_en":"On 20 November, Guangzhou Metro confirmed that Guanqiao station on Line 4 has completed its provisional handover of the three management rights — local management, dispatch command and equipment use — moving from construction into operational testing, with opening planned before year-end. The elevated side-platform station in Panyu District sits between Xinzao and Shiji stations and will interchange with Guangdong Intercity’s Guanqiaobei station, strengthening Line 4’s role along Guangzhou’s southern expansion corridor.","title":"广州4号线官桥站年底前开通运营","title_en":"Guangzhou Line 4’s Guanqiao station to open by year-end"},{"city":"sjz","color":"#E53E30","date":"2026年11月23日","date_en":"23 November 2026","id":"sjz1","source":"石家庄轨道交通","source_en":"Shijiazhuang Metro","summary":"为配合1号线二期北段及三期试运行工作，自11月23日起，石家庄地铁1号线各站首末班车时间调整，乘客需留意站内公示、合理安排出行。二期北段（福泽—东洋，3.1公里、2座车站）与三期（西王向西延伸，3.7公里、2座车站）均已进入试运行阶段，预计年底开通。两段开通后，1号线将向北延至东洋、向西延至槐安路方向，石家庄地铁的覆盖范围与运营里程将进一步扩大；地面公交也已启动配套优化意见征询，拟对17条线路调整接驳。","summary_en":"To support trial operation on the northern section of Line 1 Phase 2 and on Phase 3, first and last train times on Shijiazhuang Metro Line 1 changed from 23 November, and passengers should check station notices. The Phase 2 north section (Fuze–Dongyang, 3.1 km, 2 stations) and Phase 3 (west from Xiwang, 3.7 km, 2 stations) are both in trial operation and expected to open by year-end. Once open, Line 1 will extend north to Dongyang and west towards Huai'an Road, widening the network's reach; the bus network has also opened consultation onfeeder adjustments to 17 routes.","title":"石家庄1号线二期北段及三期进入试运行，11月23日起首末班车调整","title_en":"Shijiazhuang Line 1 extensions enter trial operation; first/last train times change from 23 November"}],"updated":"2026-11-24"}
